ind":"announcement","title":"RANDOM ENCOUNTER DEAD","summary":"Hated by most, loved by people who long for a past almost forgotten: random encounters. There are still random encounters despite the headline. But now they are visible. You can avoid them, you know where they are, they no longer hold power over you. Well, some block the way I guess, but this is now something you can see with your own eyes. This is one of many changes in the pipeline to improve the pacing of the game. Stay tuned! Claas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:10:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029708","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:48:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4972020-1845383656378535","game_id":"steam-4972020","kind":"announcement","title":"HUEMON Demo Available","summary":"After roughly one year of development time, here is my first major milestone: the demo. What can you expect?The demo is the start of the game including the very first challenge stamp. On your way across three towns and many characters you will be able to collect roughly a dozen kinds of HUEMON, be greeted by a tutorial system and get a solid idea of what the game has to offer. Things may still change, but your demo save carries over to the full game. The fastest playtester run took more than an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T17:53:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378535","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4972020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4972020":"2026-10-26T05:53:28Z"},"notices":[